<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!-- Mechanism category — weapon has a Stab tool. Two independent trait families ride the thrust;
       token registry:
         • "Point" — the point's shape/construction, one per weapon: ArmorSpike (floors the Stab
           tool's armor penetration), NeedlePoint (coupled damage/armor-pen buff at a slight
           hit-chance cost), Barbed (reroutes the base Stab to the bleedier, scar-prone
           UMW_Stab_Ragged).
         • "Coating" — what the point is dressed with, one per weapon: Envenomed (ToxicBuildup
           venom; additionally tags "Color" because it forces the green tint, so it can't co-occur
           with a Gold/Jade inlay) or Tranquilizing (sedative capture coating; deliberately forces
           NO colour, so the Color channel stays free).
       A coating combines freely with a point shape — a pointed weapon can be e.g. "armor-spiked,
       envenomed". -->
  <WeaponCategoryDef>
    <defName>UMW_Pointed</defName>
    <label>pointed</label>
  </WeaponCategoryDef>

</Defs>
